pmc:TranserfingAwarenessOfInnerFreedomAndMasteryOfTheLayerAft a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Awareness of inner freedom and mastery of the layer"@en, "Bewusstsein innerer Freiheit und Herrschaft über die Schicht"@de ;
    skos:definition "The felt certainty of being master of one's layer; once experienced, everything is said to unfold by itself without particular techniques."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state or ability the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen5 ;
    dcterms:source "Vadim Zeland, Transerfing real'nosti, Stupen' V: Yabloki padayut v nebo (2006), afterword A Strange Reality, section 'The Intention of the Ancient Magicians'; read in the English translation of the combined edition, Reality Transurfing: steps 1-5 (OJSC Ves Publishing Group, 2012), translator not named, which carries no page numbers; the afterword is not in the Bulgarian translation of this Stupen' (Ябълките падат в небето), which closes instead with a short address На гости на вечността, so whether it belongs to the single volume of 2006 is open" .

pmc:TranserfingWayOfLifeBeforeThatAwarenessAft a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Way of life before that awareness"@en, "Lebensweise vor diesem Bewusstsein"@de ;
    skos:definition "That level of awareness requires making Transurfing a way of life."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:TranserfingAwarenessOfInnerFreedomAndMasteryOfTheLayerAft ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:TranserfingMakingTransurfingAWayOfLifeAft ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "The author says there is no other route to it."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
