pmp:TranserfingMakingTransurfingAWayOfLifeAft a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Making Transurfing a way of life"@en, "Transurfing zur Lebensweise machen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Live Transurfing as an entertaining game with the mirror: keep setting your attitude to the world against the delayed response of the mirror, so the mind learns that intention shapes the layer; keep the focus of intention and let the flow bring the means, holding the target slide and observing coordination."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen5 ;
    dcterms:source "Vadim Zeland, Transerfing real'nosti, Stupen' V: Yabloki padayut v nebo (2006), afterword A Strange Reality, section 'The Intention of the Ancient Magicians'; read in the English translation of the combined edition, Reality Transurfing: steps 1-5 (OJSC Ves Publishing Group, 2012), translator not named, which carries no page numbers; the afterword is not in the Bulgarian translation of this Stupen' (Ябълките падат в небето), which closes instead with a short address На гости на вечността, so whether it belongs to the single volume of 2006 is open" .

pmc:TranserfingWayOfLifeYieldsMasteryOfTheLayerAft a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Way of life yields mastery of the layer"@en, "Lebensweise ergibt Herrschaft über die Schicht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Living it teaches the mind that one shapes one's layer with intention."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:TranserfingMakingTransurfingAWayOfLifeAft ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:TranserfingAwarenessOfInnerFreedomAndMasteryOfTheLayerAft ;
