pmc:TranserfingFocusOfIntentionSetsTheFlowsVectorAft a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Focus of intention sets the flow's vector"@en, "Absichtsfokus bestimmt die Richtung des Stroms"@de ;
    skos:definition "Foundational principle: the focus of intention fixes the direction of the alternatives flow, so the means need not and cannot be known; with the slide held and coordination observed, the flow is said by law to carry one to the goal."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
